<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run beside</i> or <i>alongside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				183e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.21
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <i>run along</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὄχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					6.53
				</span></i>
			; of winds, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὰ κοῖλα τῆς Εὐβοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Vent.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run to one side of</i> or <i>overrun</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀρθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					171c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>run beyond, outrun</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.7.12
			</span></i>; <i>run past</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>touch on cursorily</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>pass on, be transient</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ οὐ μένειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					4.6.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
